    "title": "Manufacturing Engineer - LG Electronics India Ventures Solutions - Apply Now",
    "description": "LG Electronics India Ventures Solutions has an exciting opening for a Manufacturing Engineer at our Kochi office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout LG Electronics India Ventures Solutions:\nLG Electronics India Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Post Graduate Diploma in relevant field\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in TPM\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n• Proficiency in Statistical Process Control\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in PLC/SCADA\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Flexible working hours\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Kochi, Kerala, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with LG Electronics India Ventures Solutions!",
